"text_representativeness":0.94025719165802,"text_excerpt":"I had some amazing shrimp creole here! Yummy! The atmosphere was nice, too, plus jazz music was playing in the background. I enjoyed my lunch here a lot."},{"business_id":"-lX4ufgPLYubI8rVxNM31w","review_id":"uxE-UNEmagOaQG4I7s0OBw","date":"2019-05-11T03:22:15","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9384211897850037,"text_excerpt":"I'm visiting New Orleans for the first time with my boyfriend. We came across a place called \"New Orleans Creole Cookery\" on Groupon (highly recommend checking Groupon for things to do or eat because you can save quite a bit of money). The staff was great, but due to the high volume of customers coming in during dinner, we only saw our waiter only a few times when he took our orders, brought out our food and at the end for our bill. He didn't check up on us or conversed much. Seems like they were busy this particular night. Our food came out really quick, in about less than 7 minutes, and this kinda makes me suspicious, but then again we ordered items that were easy to prepare. Alligator ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"-lX4ufgPLYubI8rVxNM31w","photo_id":"R1VWL5dcGUBIXQ4b7cUWPA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/R1VWL5dcGUBIXQ4b7cUWPA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8833047151565552},{"business_id":"-lX4ufgPLYubI8rVxNM31w","photo_id":"lE8PfMxiDxVKOW4ax0xzbQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/lE8PfMxiDxVKOW4ax0xzbQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8677687048912048},{"business_id":"-lX4ufgPLYubI8rVxNM31w","photo_id":"_0AYCskWnvkcpqhUrPWkvQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/_0AYCskWnvkcpqhUrPWkvQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8519765138626099},{"business_id":"-lX4ufgPLYubI8rVxNM31w","photo_id":"R-djhCixmF11li4rD85tFA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/R-djhCixmF11li4rD85tFA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8070014715194702},{"business_id":"-lX4ufgPLYubI8rVxNM31w","photo_id":"20hzgmVlRMxpvo_XcYTTvQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/20hzgmVlRMxpvo_XcYTT